  "id": "state.query",
  "title": "Query public state",
  "description": "Read registered public state with filters, projections, sorting, pagination and declared relations. No filesystem scan, source refresh, network requests or business writes. Secrets and authentication data are excluded. Default page size 50; use limit and select for output size. No default deadline or scan/concurrency ceiling. Results report pagination and per-source observations; unknown fields/views and invalid cursors return invalid_input.",
